1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,920
Ever wonder which cell tower your phone is actually talking to?

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,580
Meet TowerScope Live.

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:09,660
TowerScope finds the tower you're connected to and shows it on a live radar, with a beam

4
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:10,800
pointing right at it.

5
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:15,160
You'll see how far away it is, which direction to face, and exactly how strong your signal

6
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:15,780
really is.

7
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,620
It does the math for you too.

8
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:22,260
It predicts the speeds you should be getting, then runs a real speed test so you can compare

9
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:22,660
the two.

10
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,300
Looking for better reception?

11
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:28,620
Walk around with Find best spot, and your phone will buzz when you hit a new best.

12
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:33,420
And if something's off, the built-in diagnosis tells you why and how to fix it.

13
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:34,780
TowerScope Live.

14
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:36,220
See your signal.

15
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:37,620
Find your tower.

16
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:38,960
Get better service.

17
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:42,420
Coming soon to Google Play, with an iPhone version on the way.
